/label \"Proof of debt\", :dl/rule \"清算人 (liquidator) が書面通知で証明期限を定める — 通知日から28日以上後でなければならない; 期限内に証明しない債権者は、その債権が証明される前になされた配当の利益から除外される。裁判所は債権者の申立てにより期限を延長できる\", :dl/anchor \"Companies Act 2014 s.674(1)-(3) (延長: s.674(4))\", :dl/source-url \"https://www.irishstatutebook.ie/eli/2014/act/38/\", :dl/verify-service-date true}]", :proc/verify-current-law true, :proc/jurisdiction :ie, :proc/genuine-channels [:mail], :proc/track :insolvency, :db/id -149, :proc/refer-when ["secured/set-off/large claim → solicitor (FLAC の無料相談も)"], :proc/trigger-keywords ["liquidation" "proof of debt" "liquidator" "winding up"], :proc/id "proc:ie-liquidation"} {:proc/options "[{:opt/id :appearance, :opt/kind :self-submit, :opt/protective true, :opt/label \"Appearance を County Registrar へ enter (応訴の意思表示)\"} {:opt/id :defence, :opt/kind :self-submit, :opt/label \"Defence + (必要なら) Affidavit of Means を Appearance から10日以内に deliver\"}]", :proc/label "Appearance + Defence (家事・アイルランド)", :proc/deadline-rules "[{:dl/label \"Appearance + Defence\", :dl/rule \"Family Law Civil Bill 送達から10日以内に County Registrar へ Appearance を enter; defend するなら Appearance から10日以内に Defence (nature & grounds) を deliver — 財産的救済が争点なら Affidavit of Means、子の福祉が問題なら関係書類も。期限は厳格でなく徒過後も受理されることが多いが早期対応が安全\", :dl/anchor \"Circuit Court Rules (Family Law) 2018 (S.I. No. 427/2018)\", :dl/source-url \"https://www.irishstatutebook.ie/eli/2018/si/427/made/en/print\", :dl/verify-service-date true}]", :proc/verify-current-law true, :proc/jurisdiction :ie, :proc/genuine-channels [:mail :personal-service], :proc/track :family, :db/id -150, :proc/refer-when ["custody/maintenance/property (親権・扶養・財産分与) が争点 → solicitor / Legal Aid Board / FLAC" "kokoro 心 (精神的サポート — 家事事件は Wellbecoming 負荷が大きい)"], :proc/trigger-keywords ["family law civil bill" "appearance" "judicial separation" "divorce"], :proc/id "proc:ie-family"} {:proc/options "[{:opt/id :rtb-dispute, :opt/kind :self-submit, :opt/protective true, :opt/label \"RTB へ dispute を申立て (Notice of Termination の有効性を争う)\"} {:opt/id :no-self-help-protection, :opt/kind :self-decide, :opt/protective true, :opt/label \"自力救済 (鍵交換・電気停止・脅迫による追い出し) は違法 — 退去は RTB/裁判所命令によってのみ; 受けたら RTB・Threshold・Gardaí へ\"}]", :proc/label "Notice of Termination dispute (住居・アイルランド)", :proc/deadline-rules "[{:dl/label \"RTB dispute\", :dl/rule \"Notice of Termination が無効と考えるなら、受領から90日以内に RTB へ dispute を申立て (家賃滞納・テナント義務違反による終了は28日); 通知だけで退去義務は生じず、RTB は有効な Notice of Termination 満了後にのみ退去を命じうる\", :dl/anchor \"Residential Tenancies Act 2004 (RTB dispute)\", :dl/source-url \"https://www.irishstatutebook.ie/eli/2004/act/27/\", :dl/verify-service-date true}]", :proc/verify-current-law true, :proc/jurisdiction :ie, :proc/genuine-channels [:mail], :proc/track :housing, :db/id -151, :proc/refer-when ["有効性が複雑・不法 eviction → solicitor / FLAC / Threshold (housing charity)"], :proc/trigger-keywords ["notice of termination" "RTB" "residential tenancies" "tenancy"], :proc/id "proc:ie-housing"} {:proc/options "[{:opt/id :means, :opt/kind :self-submit, :opt/protective true, :opt/label \"出頭し means statement を提出 (合理的生活費を踏まえた支払能力を示し、過大な instalment を回避/見直し)\"} {:opt/id :verify, :opt/kind :self-decide, :opt/protective true, :opt/label \"instalment が means を超えていないか確認; committal は wilful refusal + 立証が要件 (単なる無資力では収監されない)\"}]", :proc/label "Instalment order / attachment of earnings (執行・アイルランド)", :proc/deadline-rules "[{:dl/label \"Instalment order / means examination への対応\", :dl/rule \"judgment 債務の execution として creditor は District Court に instalment order を申立て、debtor は出頭し means を establish する (Enforcement of Court Orders Act 1926 s.15)。裁判官は debtor の means を考慮して全額 or 分割を命じる (合理的生活費を残す means ベースの査定)。attachment of earnings は主に maintenance (扶養) order に用いられる。committal は means があるのに wilful refusal を beyond reasonable doubt で立証した場合のみ — debtor は means/支出を申告し過大な instalment の見直しを求められる\", :dl/anchor \"Enforcement of Court Orders Act 1926 s.15 (+ Acts 1926-2009, O.53 District Court Rules)\", :dl/source-url \"https://www.irishstatuteboo